     4	// Mirrors net.minecraft.world.level.gameevent.vibrations.VibrationInfo, except the
     5	// game event itself is replaced by its precomputed vibration frequency: the generated
     6	// pumpkin_data::GameEvent enum (pumpkin-data/src/generated/game_event.rs) derives
     7	// nothing (no Copy/Clone/PartialEq), and that file may not be edited, so it cannot be
     8	// stored and compared across ticks the way vanilla's Holder<GameEvent> is. Selection
     9	// only ever needs the frequency (see `shouldReplaceVibration`), so storing it directly
    10	// loses nothing for this purpose.
    11	#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq)]
