    16	///
    17	/// The search spirals outwards from `origin` ring by ring in steps of
    18	/// `horizontal_step` blocks up to `horizontal_radius`, probing each column at
    19	/// y levels spreading out from the origin y in steps of `vertical_step`
    20	/// (staying within the dimension's build height). The first match wins, which
    21	/// approximates the nearest one just like vanilla.
    22	///
