The confirmed behavioral gap is `ZombieVillager.getVoicePitch`: vanilla uses the baby/adult-specific random pitch when sounds are emitted, but Pumpkin’s ambient and hurt paths currently hard-code pitch `1.0`. I’m adding a mob sound-pitch hook, wiring those two server sound paths, and adding a deterministic range test for the zombie-villager formula. The remaining leads map to existing recipe tables/matchers, NBT/state fields, status broadcasts, or client-only handlers.
Source tracing found one server-observable gap (zombie-villager voice pitch); other leads have existing equivalent machinery.
