codex
I found one genuine MerchantMenu gap: vanilla tracks the XP of the currently valid trade in `MerchantContainer.futureXp` and exposes it through `getFutureTraderXp`; Pumpkin currently computes the active offer but drops that value. I’ll add the field/getter, maintain it whenever the result slot is recomputed, and cover valid/invalid offers with a focused unit test.
apply patch
patch: completed
