    10	//! DEVIATION: `LandRandomPos.getPos(mob, 5, 4)` is still represented by a uniform random offset
    11	//! in the same +/-5 horizontal, +/-4 vertical box and lets the navigator reject unreachable
    12	//! destinations. The source's on-fire water search is ported below.
